  "assertions": [
    "A protected streamed report carries Max-Age zero and completes all five credited frames before renewal",
    "Renewal occurs at least 1000 ms after that report, sends GET Observe=0 for the original route and token with a new Message ID, and preserves Accept zero",
    "The authenticated renewal response advances the Observe serial and emits the next contiguous credited inline report",
    "Explicit cancellation after renewal uses the original token, completes only after a response without Observe and removes the server observer",
    "With renew false, the complete initial Max-Age-zero report is written before exactly one observation_stale terminal envelope",
    "Disabled-renewal expiry sends best-effort token-matched cancellation and the worker exits cleanly"
  ],
